                <invention-title lang="en">BATTERY MODULE, BATERY PACK AND VEHICLE COMPRISING SAME</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided are a battery module configured to ensure structural stability even when a thermal event occurs, a battery pack, and a vehicle including the battery pack.A battery module includes a cell assembly including a plurality of battery cells, and a compression pad assembly located between the plurality of battery cells, the compression pad assembly including a heat blocking unit in which at least one hollow portion is formed.</p>
